# 🇮🇳 BharatMCP

AI chatbot platform that actually DOES things on your website.

## Quick Start (Docker)

```bash
# 1. Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/your-username/bharatmcp.git
cd bharatmcp

# 2. Create your .env file
cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
# Edit backend/.env → add your GEMINI_API_KEY

# 3. Start everything
make up

# That's it. Running at http://localhost:8000
```

## Commands

```bash
make up          # Start all services (backend + MongoDB + Redis)
make down        # Stop everything
make logs        # View backend logs
make restart     # Restart backend after code changes
make build       # Rebuild from scratch
make shell       # SSH into backend container
make db-shell    # Open MongoDB shell
make clean       # Nuke everything (containers + data)
make status      # Check what's running
```

## Services

| Service   | URL                    | Purpose              |
|-----------|------------------------|----------------------|
| Backend   | http://localhost:8000  | FastAPI API server   |
| MongoDB   | localhost:27017        | Database             |
| Redis     | localhost:6379         | Cache + rate limits  |
| Docs      | http://localhost:8000/docs | Swagger API docs |

## Project Structure

```
bharatmcp/
├── backend/           ← FastAPI (Python)
├── widget/            ← Chat widget (JS) — Phase 2
├── dashboard/         ← Admin panel (Next.js) — Phase 3
├── docker-compose.yml ← Runs everything
├── Makefile           ← Shortcuts
└── README.md
```